---
// GM / OnStar telemetry data flow (FTC press release, January 2025).
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads (no marker ids).
const W = 900;
const H = 292;
---
<figure class="egm">
  <div class="egm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Data flow in the General Motors OnStar case: car sensors send location and driving behavior to OnStar Smart Driver, then to GM, then to consumer reporting agencies, then to insurers who set rates. The hop from GM to reporting agencies happened without clear consent, and higher rates return to the driver.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>One car, five hops: where the consent went missing</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một chiếc xe, năm chặng: sự đồng thuận biến mất ở đâu</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Facts from the FTC press release on General Motors and OnStar, January 2025.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dữ kiện từ thông cáo của FTC về General Motors và OnStar, tháng 1/2025.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="112" width="152" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="32" y="144" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Car and driver</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xe và tài xế</tspan></text>
      <text x="22" y="190" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Location, as often as</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vị trí, có lúc mỗi</tspan></text>
      <text x="22" y="208" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>every 3 seconds for</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 giây một lần với</tspan></text>
      <text x="22" y="226" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>some users</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một số người dùng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="197" y="112" width="152" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="209" y="144" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>OnStar Smart Driver</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>OnStar Smart Driver</tspan></text>
      <text x="199" y="190" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Hard braking, late-night</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phanh gấp, lái đêm,</tspan></text>
      <text x="199" y="208" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>driving and speeding</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy quá tốc độ</tspan></text>
      <text x="199" y="226" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>are recorded</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>được ghi lại</tspan></text>
      <rect x="374" y="112" width="152" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="386" y="144" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>GM</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GM</tspan></text>
      <text x="376" y="190" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Enrollment was</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Việc đăng ký bị mô tả</tspan></text>
      <text x="376" y="208" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>described as confusing</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>là khó hiểu và gây</tspan></text>
      <text x="376" y="226" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>and misleading</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hiểu nhầm</tspan></text>
      <rect x="551" y="112" width="152" height="52" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <text x="563" y="144" class="bh red"><tspan data-lang-en>Reporting agencies</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Công ty báo cáo</tspan></text>
      <text x="553" y="190" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Consumer reporting</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các công ty báo cáo</tspan></text>
      <text x="553" y="208" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>agencies receive</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>người tiêu dùng nhận</tspan></text>
      <text x="553" y="226" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>the data</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dữ liệu</tspan></text>
      <rect x="728" y="112" width="152" height="52" rx="8" class="box" />
      <text x="740" y="144" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Insurers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hãng bảo hiểm</tspan></text>
      <text x="730" y="190" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>Use the reports to</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng báo cáo để</tspan></text>
      <text x="730" y="208" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>set rates or deny</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>định phí hoặc từ chối</tspan></text>
      <text x="730" y="226" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>coverage</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bảo hiểm</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow"><path d="M 172 138 L 191.0 138.0" /><polygon points="197,138 189.8,141.5 189.8,134.5" /></g>
      <g class="arrow"><path d="M 349 138 L 368.0 138.0" /><polygon points="374,138 366.8,141.5 366.8,134.5" /></g>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 526 138 L 545.0 138.0" /><polygon points="551,138 543.8,141.5 543.8,134.5" /></g>
      <g class="arrow"><path d="M 703 138 L 722.0 138.0" /><polygon points="728,138 720.8,141.5 720.8,134.5" /></g>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 804 112 L 804 92 L 96 92 L 96 105" /><polygon points="96,112 92,103 100,103" /></g>
      <text x="450" y="82" class="redtxt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Higher rates land back on the driver</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phí cao hơn quay lại đè lên tài xế</tspan></text>
      
      <line x1="538" y1="176" x2="538" y2="256" class="cut" />
      <text x="538" y="278" class="redtxt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Consent missing at this hop</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thiếu đồng thuận ở chặng này</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>How driving data left the car, per the FTC. The red dashed line marks the hop the FTC says happened without consumers' consent; the order proposed in January 2025 bans that hop for five years.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Dữ liệu lái xe rời khỏi chiếc xe như thế nào, theo FTC. Đường đứt đỏ đánh dấu chặng mà FTC cho là diễn ra khi chưa có sự đồng ý của người dùng; lệnh đề xuất tháng 1/2025 cấm chặng này trong 5 năm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .egm { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .egm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .egm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .egm text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .egm .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .egm .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .egm .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .egm .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .egm .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .egm .bh { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .egm .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .egm .small { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .egm .note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .egm .redtxt { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .egm .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .egm .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .egm .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .egm .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .egm .cut { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .egm .divider { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .egm figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
